comment DATA:6520 1 shl player: the lights and objects keep a bit per player
name DATA:6521 player_recs
name DATA:84E2 player_1
comment DATA:84E2 eight records of 98h bytes: +0 score (6 bytes BCD, low first; checked; +6, +7 unused but see add_booster), +8 bonus (6 bytes BCD, 8 reserved), +10h boosters: the hits of td_count_obj2 (BCD word), +12h the same count binary, +14h the hits of td_count_obj (BCD word), +16h the same binary, +18h..+97h what each lamp shows, a byte each in the order of td_lights' groups (update_lights)
name DATA:857A player_2
