name DATA:84A6 td_lanes_a_upper
name DATA:84A8 td_lanes_b_lower
name DATA:84AA td_lanes_b_upper
name DATA:84AC td_lights
comment DATA:84AC the lists of td_* end with a negative word (FFFFh); the records they reach are described at their users: lamps and light groups (update_lights, blink_lights), groups, targets and hit rectangles (test_hit_rects), lanes (test_lanes_a), holes (map_event_run), locks (reset_locks), event objects (run_events), sequences (run_event), messages (message_step)
name DATA:84AE td_rotating
comment DATA:84AE light groups whose lit bits move one lamp along when a flipper is pressed (rotate_lights)
name DATA:84B0 td_extra_ball
name DATA:84B2 td_ign_timers
comment DATA:84B2 records: +0 frames left, +2 the period, +4 a light group, +6 a sequence, +8 sound (high byte) and jingle; each period the last lit lamp of the group goes out (with the sound) and the sequence's step goes back by one (ign_timers)
name DATA:84B4 td_chains
comment DATA:84B4 light groups lit in order: the first lamp not lit for the player blinks (flag 40h), the ones after it are cleared (light_chains)
name DATA:84B6 td_random_lights
comment DATA:84B6 targets; one of them (by frame_count) gets its lamp blinking (flag 2); hitting that one runs the event of td_random_event's group (pick_random_light, random_light_check)
name DATA:84B8 td_random_event
name DATA:84BA td_locks
comment DATA:84BA records of 6 bytes: +0 the hole, +2 its lamp (flags 14h: blinks when lit, while the locks are lit), +4 FFFFh while a ball is in it
name DATA:84BC td_objects
name DATA:84BE td_timed
comment DATA:84BE event objects with a timer (+24h, +26h; object_timers)
name DATA:84C0 td_events
comment DATA:84C0 the sequences whose steps go back to 0 at a new ball (unless their byte +1 is set) and a new game (reset_objects)
name DATA:84C2 td_count_obj
comment DATA:84C2 the event object whose hits are counted at player record +14h (BCD) and +16h; at count_target the sequence of td_count_event's group (+2) runs and the count starts again (count_object)
name DATA:844C count_target
comment DATA:844C hits of td_count_obj for its event: 9 Ignition, 4 Steel Wheel, 1 the others
name DATA:84C4 td_count_event
name DATA:84C6 td_count_obj2
comment DATA:84C6 the event object whose hits are counted at player record +10h (BCD; Ignition shows it) and +12h
name DATA:84C8 td_count_texts
name DATA:84CA td_hurry
comment DATA:84CA the event object of the hurry-up: while armed (+22h) hurry_value rises every frame (Nightmare: falls, disarmed at 0) and td_txt_hurry shows it (display_frame)
name DATA:84CC td_txt_hurry
name DATA:84CE td_txt_jackpot2
name DATA:84D0 td_txt_jackpot3
name DATA:84D2 td_txt_jackpot4
